  (text "GPIO: IN1-4 = GPIO17/27/22/5 (low = input on), OUT1-4 = GPIO24/25/12/16, status LED GPIO23,"
    (at 280 250 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "07a16210-3ccd-5103-b5c4-7610571824f3"))
  (text "I2C GPIO2/3 (BME280 0x76, ADS1115 0x48, DS3231 0x68), 1-Wire GPIO4. 5 V goes to the Pi pins 2/4:"
